About the role

Join IPE Precision Machinery Limited as a full-time Quality Assurance Supervisor based in Ayutthaya, Thailand. In this critical role, you will oversee and maintain the quality standards of our manufacturing processes and output, ensuring we deliver exceptional products to our customers.
Job Responsibilities:
1. Develop detailed and actionable inspection plans and standards based on product drawings, technical specifications, and quality standards;
2. Monitor QA staff Using professional testing equipment and tools to conduct strict quality inspections on the raw materials, semi-finished products, and final products of automotive metal parts etc during the production process;
3. Responsible for quality monitoring of the production process on site;
4. Quickly organize relevant departments (such as production, technology, process, etc.) to conduct in-depth investigation and analysis of quality issues that arise during the production process and customer feedback on quality complaints. Analyze the quality problems in the workshop and propose improvement directions;
5. Monitor handling supplier quality issues;
6. Participate in new product development and quality planning, and provide professional opinions and suggestions on product design and process plans from a quality perspective;
7. Complete other working tasks temporarily assigned by company leader on time, with guaranteed quality and quantity.

Qualification Requirements:
1. Full time undergraduate degree or above, majoring in mechanical engineering, material forming and control engineering, or related fields;
2. Currently working in Thailand; Proficient in computer operation;
3. Proficient in Thai and English, Those who can speak Chinese (fluent in listening and speaking Mandarine) will be preferred;
